<article id="HTML-ELEM" class="WebBits">
    <h2>TRY: Create HTML elements</h2>
    <p><strong>HyperText Markup Language</strong>, <abbr title="HyperText Markup Language">HTML</abbr>, holds the text of a webpage together and structures the page using symantic elements.</p>
    <div class="colorcode">
        <button class="reset">RESET</button>
        <ol class="slct">
            <li class="Tagopen Selector-elem">Opening-Tag</li>
            <li class="Tagclose">Closing-Tag</li>
            <li class="TextVal">Text</li>
            <li class="Attribute">Attribute</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="codefig">
            <p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;body&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT"></p><pre class="EXTXT">

  </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;header&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;h1 <span class="Attribute EXTXT">id="RandomWebBits"</span>&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">&amp;lt;Random Web Bits&amp;gt;</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/h1&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;nav&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

      </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;ul&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

        </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;li&gt;</p><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;a&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">Link one</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/a&gt;</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/li&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

        </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;li&gt;</p><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;a&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">Link two</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/a&gt;</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/li&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

        </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;li&gt;</p><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;a&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">Link three</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/a&gt;</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/li&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

      </pre><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/ul&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/nav&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

  </pre><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/header&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

  </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;main&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;time <span class="Attribute EXTXT">datetime="2023-07-25"</span>&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">July 25, 2023</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/time&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;article <span class="Attribute EXTXT">id="HTML-ELEM"</span> <span class="Attribute EXTXT">class="WebBits"</span>&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT"></p><pre class="EXTXT">

      </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;h2&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">Short Article</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/h2&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

      </pre><p class="Tagopen EXTXT">&lt;p&gt;</p><p class="TextVal EXTXT">HTML elements structure a page in the web. They apply symantic meaning through the use of the tag name and the tag's placement.</p><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/p&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

    </pre><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/article&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

  </pre><p class="Tagclose EXTXT">&lt;/main&gt;</p><pre class="EXTXT">

